 I'm not sure about this shopping mall idea. It doesn't quit fit.
It does sound fun though! Maybe a time travel element could be
added or something like that. 
 Like: "You have found a time portal. Do you wish to enter? [yn]
        You walk through the time portal. --More--
        You find yourself in front of a large stone building. --More--
        There are lots of people everywhere. --More--
        People are looking at you very strangely, 
        but they go out of their way not to talk to you. --More--
        You notice none of them are wearing armor! --More--
        You think to yourself "This should be easy!" --More--
        You notice one of the strange men wearing a flat hat
        and a leather belt with some metal device hanging from it
        is watching you more closely than anybody else! --More--
        You also notice there are lots of stores in this building --More--
        One of them even sells those strange metal things.... --More--
  etc. You get the Idea.
 All kinds of things could happen. Lots of stuff could be added to the game
this way. Guns, bulletproof vests, illegal drugs...
 Maybe there could be a chance of being teleported to an Orc mall. 
The Orcs attack...
 To get back you have to find another time portal on the mall level.
Anyway my point is that it shouldn't be a regular level. There should be
some special way to get there, like a teleport to valt trap.
 Well just thought I would add my input on what sounds like the next major
addition to an already great game. Keep up the great work dev team!
 Thanks for the game!
